      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Transfer and Assumption of Functions. Upon the transfer of\ncertain functions pursuant to the terms and conditions of the MOU dated June 11, 2019\nspecifying such functions, the DOE shall assume the performance of such functions,\nconsistent with such terms and conditions.",
