    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        224,
        1296,
        1474,
        1480
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(c) In accordance with applicable law, employees of ACS, upon\nbecoming employees of DOE, may elect to transfer their pension service credit from\nNew York City Employees' Retirement System (\"NYCERS\") to the Board of\nEducation Retirement System (\"BERS\") or may elect to remain in NYCERS as\ntransferred contributors.",
