      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 4. Additional Transfers. The transfer from ACS to DOE of additional\nfunctions associated with monitoring, coordinating, and providing support to the EarlyLearn\nContracted Services is hereby authorized, subject to the execution of one or more additional\nmemoranda of understanding between ACS and DOE specifying such additional functions,\nin accordance with law, including applicable provisions of the Civil Service Law.",
